{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>World Setting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the Golden Age, magic and industry flourished, and human civilization reached unprecedented heights. But just as a new era dawned, the sky shattered, and mysterious crimson \u201cStar Remnants\u201d fell, seeping a red liquid across the land. Red Mist quickly spread, corrupting creatures and turning them into monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the shattered Star Remnants, chaotic energy crystallized into \u201cCrimson Ore,\u201d marking the catastrophe known as the Starfall Disaster, which reshaped the world\u2019s laws.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the calamity, much of the continent fell into chaos. Humans built fragmented camps to explore these lands, where heroes arrived to establish shelters. Though humble, these refuges offered warmth, with roaming crow merchants, magic tutors of the Azure Council,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > technologically adept Mechanists, and above all, the \u201cLeader\u201d overseeing each territory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hero Profile</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956120/extras/d123a5602eeae2654ea81574b6a62ab7.poster.avif?t=1770971126\" width=654 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956120/extras/d123a5602eeae2654ea81574b6a62ab7.webm?t=1770971126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon: Spirit Sepulcher</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wielding the Erosion-Marked Bone Bow, the Spirit Hunter is shrouded in lingering soul echoes. As one of the few who can resonate with lost souls in the Red Mist, her arrows always carry a wail and a piercing scream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956120/extras/7791c6bc6106d54102c621ab9cdb7c47.poster.avif?t=1770971126\" width=654 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956120/extras/7791c6bc6106d54102c621ab9cdb7c47.webm?t=1770971126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon: Crimson Cinder</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Crimson Envoy wields a massive greatsword, able to alter its attack form and elemental damage through unique skills. This blood-red blade, as tall as its wielder, resounds in battle with a heartbeat-like thrum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Combat System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features classic ARPG gameplay. As the \u201cHero,\u201d you embark on an epic journey, honing your skills, upgrading talents, and facing ever-stronger foes in pursuit of the truth behind the \u201cStarAbyss.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3956120?t=1770971126","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3956120?t=1770971126","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956120/c933b6ed87bc9d30a18f3b9531c36f1d6bfdf6f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770971126","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956120/c933b6ed87bc9d30a18f3b9531c36f1d6bfdf6f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770971126","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Female characters in combat, wearing slightly revealing outfits, with no other sexual content."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>World Setting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the Golden Age, magic and industry flourished, and human civilization reached unprecedented heights. But just as a new era dawned, the sky shattered, and mysterious crimson \u201cStar Remnants\u201d fell, seeping a red liquid across the land. Red Mist quickly spread, corrupting creatures and turning them into monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the shattered Star Remnants, chaotic energy crystallized into \u201cCrimson Ore,\u201d marking the catastrophe known as the Starfall Disaster, which reshaped the world\u2019s laws.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the calamity, much of the continent fell into chaos. Humans built fragmented camps to explore these lands, where heroes arrived to establish shelters. Though humble, these refuges offered warmth, with roaming crow merchants, magic tutors of the Azure Council,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > technologically adept Mechanists, and above all, the \u201cLeader\u201d overseeing each territory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hero Profile</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956120/extras/d123a5602eeae2654ea81574b6a62ab7.poster.avif?t=1770971126\" width=654 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956120/extras/d123a5602eeae2654ea81574b6a62ab7.webm?t=1770971126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon: Spirit Sepulcher</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wielding the Erosion-Marked Bone Bow, the Spirit Hunter is shrouded in lingering soul echoes. As one of the few who can resonate with lost souls in the Red Mist, her arrows always carry a wail and a piercing scream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956120/extras/7791c6bc6106d54102c621ab9cdb7c47.poster.avif?t=1770971126\" width=654 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956120/extras/7791c6bc6106d54102c621ab9cdb7c47.webm?t=1770971126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon: Crimson Cinder</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Crimson Envoy wields a massive greatsword, able to alter its attack form and elemental damage through unique skills. This blood-red blade, as tall as its wielder, resounds in battle with a heartbeat-like thrum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Combat System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features classic ARPG gameplay. As the \u201cHero,\u201d you embark on an epic journey, honing your skills, upgrading talents, and facing ever-stronger foes in pursuit of the truth behind the \u201cStarAbyss.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["GOCORE"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956120/322db6331929faa1a6d1837a693d28a287ff766f/header.jpg?t=1